sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Khách hàng
    actor S as Nhân viên
    participant FE as business-store-frontend
    participant C as CustomOrderRequestController
    participant CO as CustomOrderRequestServiceImpl
    participant M as CloudinaryMediaStorageService
    participant CL as Cloudinary
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant N as NotificationEventListener
    participant SMTP as SMTP
    participant O as OrderServiceImpl
    U->>FE: Tạo yêu cầu đặt riêng
    FE->>C: POST /api/v1/custom-order-requests (JSON/HTTPS)
    C->>CO: create(userId, request)
    CO->>DB: Ghi CustomOrderRequest status NEW (JPA/JDBC)
    opt Có ảnh tham khảo
        FE->>C: POST /mine/{id}/images (multipart/HTTPS)
        C->>CO: uploadImage(userId, id, file)
        CO->>M: uploadCustomOrderImage
        M->>CL: Upload ảnh authenticated (HTTPS API)
        CO->>DB: Ghi CustomOrderImage (JPA/JDBC)
    end
    S->>C: PUT /{id}/quote (JSON/HTTPS)
    C->>CO: quote(id, QuoteCustomOrderRequest)
    CO->>DB: Khóa request, ghi giá và status QUOTED
    Note over CO,N: Sau transaction commit
    CO->>N: CustomOrderQuotedEvent (Spring event)
    N->>SMTP: Gửi email báo giá (SMTP, @Async)
    U->>C: PUT /mine/{id}/quote-decision (JSON/HTTPS)
    C->>CO: decideQuote(userId, id, accepted)
    alt Từ chối
        CO->>DB: Đổi request sang CANCELLED (JPA/JDBC)
    else Đồng ý có shippingAddressId
        CO->>O: createFromCustomRequest(userId, addressId, request)
        O->>DB: Ghi Order và snapshot địa chỉ (JPA/JDBC)
        CO->>DB: Liên kết Order, đổi request sang CONFIRMED
    end
